I'm now focusing on validating the integration with Veo models. I'm noting potential discrepancies between the code's model name, `veo-3-1-flash`, and the expected Vertex AI model identifiers. My analysis of `geminiService.ts` confirms the code specifically tests this model, suggesting a possible user concern with its accessibility or usage. I will ensure model names align correctly, and document any findings to minimize user friction.


